VIOLATION — graded against `rules/rule-authoring.md`. compliant=false, with FOUR breaches, all
four inside the single numbered clause.

First, the clause HEADING states an obligation and the BODY hedges throughout — should generally,
is encouraged to move toward, where that is practical, usually less helpful, tends to be worth
avoiding, may reasonably — and its closing sentence RETURNS the very case the heading forbids:
where a scratch environment is not readily available the session may record the target on the
write and schedule the rehearsal for the next drill cycle. That is the forbidden disposition,
handed back as an allowance.

Second, the `**BLOCKED rationalizations:**` heading is present and holds six ABSTRACT category
labels — exit-code substitution, vendor-reputation transfer, budget-based deferral,
documentation-as-execution, calendar displacement, size-signal reliance — instead of the literal
first-person sentences a session emits. It traps nothing, because no session ever writes those
words.

Third, the two arms of the worked block are the SAME LINE. Both restore into scratch, both compare
four tables, both record the target as coverage; they are separated only by the trailing adverbs
ideally and belatedly. The contrast slot is filled and carries no contrast.

Fourth, the clause justification runs well past the two-sentence cap, wandering into multipart
uploads, per-table versus aggregate exit status, team muscle memory, who funds the scratch cluster,
and how a deferred rehearsal looks in the coverage table.

NOT FINDINGS — shared byte-for-byte with the sibling pole: the frontmatter, the whole `## MUST NOT`
section including its one-sentence justification, the entire Trust Posture Wiring block with its
eight canonical fields and its structurally-grounded Phase-2 deferral, and the `## Origin` section.
A judge naming any of those, or naming the deferred detector, has scored furniture rather than
content.

Surface-equalized with the sibling pole: identical `## ` heading skeleton, one numbered clause each,
one `# DO` block each, a `**BLOCKED rationalizations:**` heading in each, and a byte ratio inside
the 1.5 cap.
